\section{Replicate weight matrix}{

The replicate weight matrix is \strong{not stored} in the object. Only the
column names are stored in \verb{@variables$repweights}. Variance estimation
computes the matrix on demand:
\code{as.matrix(design@data[, design@variables$repweights])}.
}

